# Keep the build context small + force a clean install inside the image.
# Host artefacts must never leak in (wrong-platform binaries, stale builds).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.vite

.git
.github
.changeset
.claude
.vscode
.idea

# runtime data + secrets (never bake into an image)
**/.data
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/env.example

# docs / scratch
**/*.md
docs
project-tree-for-ai.txt
structure.txt
**/*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
